  {
   "variant": "V1 (interpreter-body)",
   "status": "not usable for this app",
   "reason": "Body-profile patch rejected at install on device: 'Bytecode patch introduces a library absent from the base snapshot' (engine log via OSLogStore; patch reported __patch_install_failure__/BootCrash, app fell back to base). V1/V2 therefore use the interpreter-structural profile, which retains all declarations (App binary 47.1 MB vs 8.2 MB for the body-profile release that was built but could not be patched). Cause (which library is pruned from the AOT snapshot) was not investigated."
  },
